{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03547","headline":"奉教追赴九成宫途中口号 · 李峤","name":"奉教追赴九成宫途中口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"委质承仙翰，只命遄遥策。\n事偶从梁游，人非背淮客。\n长驱历川阜，迥眺穷原泽。\n郁郁桑柘繁，油油禾黍积。\n雨余林气静，日下山光夕。\n未攀丛桂岩，犹倦飘蓬陌。\n行当奉麾盖，慰此劳行役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}